.TH FATHOM_COMPLETIONS 1  "fathom 0.1.0-alpha.1" 
.SH NAME
fathom\-completions \- Print the shell\*(Aqs own copy of this grammar: completion scripts and man pages (`e7.4`)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfathom completions\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the shell\*(Aqs own copy of this grammar: completion scripts and man pages (`e7.4`)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
fathom\-completions\-bash(1)
The completion script for bash, to drop in `.../bash\-completion/completions/fathom`
.TP
fathom\-completions\-zsh(1)
The completion script for zsh, to drop in a `$fpath` directory as `_fathom`
.TP
fathom\-completions\-fish(1)
The completion script for fish, to drop in `.../fish/vendor_completions.d/fathom.fish`
.TP
fathom\-completions\-man(1)
The man pages, rendered from the same grammar
